msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"
"Language: es\n"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to seat a member in one of its roles, until a date you pick or the end of the season."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que asigne a un miembro a uno de sus roles, hasta una fecha que usted elija o hasta el final de la temporada."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing puts the payout to the village. A passed vote releases it through the settlement the quest already uses."
msgstr "Publicar somete el pago a la aldea. Una votación aprobada lo libera a través de la liquidación que la misión ya usa."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The quest"
msgstr "La misión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "People"
msgstr "Personas"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who would do it"
msgstr "Quién lo haría"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A change to the structure"
msgstr "Un cambio en la estructura"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Money"
msgstr "Dinero"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Roles come from the village's org chart. One proposal for several roles records your terms once."
msgstr "Los roles vienen del organigrama de la aldea. Una propuesta para varios roles registra sus términos una sola vez."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Minting rule change"
msgstr "Cambio en la regla de emisión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Dominio"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Quiet hours in the common house"
msgstr "Horas de silencio en la casa común"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who looks after it"
msgstr "Quién lo cuida"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "This adds one power to a role. Taking one off a role is not something a vote does, so a role the village armed cannot be quietly disarmed by another one."
msgstr "Esto agrega un poder a un rol. Quitarle uno a un rol no es algo que haga una votación, así que un rol que la aldea equipó no puede ser desarmado en silencio por otro."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A badge can carry capabilities, so a term is how a grant stays a decision. Without one it becomes permanent by default."
msgstr "Una insignia puede llevar capacidades, así que un plazo es lo que mantiene el otorgamiento como una decisión. Sin plazo, se vuelve permanente por defecto."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Move one of the village's dials, with the reasoning that goes with it."
msgstr "Mover uno de los ajustes de la aldea, con el razonamiento que lo acompaña."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Hand a power back"
msgstr "Devolver un poder"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "This is the part the roll reads before it votes."
msgstr "Esta es la parte que el padrón lee antes de votar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why the village is ready for this one"
msgstr "Por qué la aldea está lista para este"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The roles"
msgstr "Los roles"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Monto"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "For how long"
msgstr "Por cuánto tiempo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The terms you would hold these roles on. Start from a preset, or from the role's own terms on offer, and change what does not fit."
msgstr "Los términos con que ocuparía estos roles. Parta de una plantilla, o de los términos que ofrece el propio rol, y cambie lo que no encaje."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "How votes are counted"
msgstr "Cómo se cuentan los votos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What makes this person the right one for this role."
msgstr "Qué hace que esta persona sea la indicada para este rol."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Propose to join the team in one role or up to three, with what you'll have done by the end of the season and the terms you hold them on."
msgstr "Proponga unirse al equipo en uno o hasta tres roles, con lo que habrá hecho al final de la temporada y los términos con que los ocupará."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The end of a moon"
msgstr "El final de una luna"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Your season"
msgstr "Su temporada"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Put a shared understanding into words the village can adopt."
msgstr "Poner un entendimiento compartido en palabras que la aldea pueda adoptar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The agreement"
msgstr "El acuerdo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who it binds, and when the village looks at it again."
msgstr "A quién compromete, y cuándo la aldea lo vuelve a mirar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Tema"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Power handed back"
msgstr "Poder devuelto"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing opens the vote to the whole roll. If it carries, the statement reads the new way from that day and every proposal opened afterwards answers to it. Nothing already decided is reopened."
msgstr "Publicar abre la votación a todo el padrón. Si se aprueba, la declaración dice lo nuevo desde ese día y cada propuesta abierta después responde a ella. Nada de lo ya decidido se reabre."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The village asks to hold this. Publishing opens the vote to the whole roll, and if it carries, the power crosses over that day: the role you named looks after it, and an admin who is not seated there has to reach past the village in the open to act on it."
msgstr "La aldea pide sostener esto. Publicar abre la votación a todo el padrón, y si se aprueba, el poder pasa ese mismo día: el rol que usted nombró lo cuida, y una persona administradora que no ocupe ese rol tiene que pasar por encima de la aldea, a la vista de todos, para usarlo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Each role's suggestion for the eight settings. Accept each one, or mark it let's talk: the people deciding see your answers. You don't write terms here."
msgstr "La sugerencia de cada rol para los ocho ajustes. Acepte cada una, o márquela como conversémoslo: quienes deciden ven sus respuestas. Aquí no escribe términos."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Token"
msgstr "Token"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which rules move, and what they become."
msgstr "Qué reglas cambian, y en qué se convierten."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Your aim for the season"
msgstr "Su propósito para la temporada"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Member"
msgstr "Miembro"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who votes here is a rule of the game, so it is changed by a rule change and never by giving a role the key."
msgstr "Quién vota aquí es una regla del juego, así que se cambia con un cambio de regla y nunca dando la llave a un rol."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Say what you have seen, not what you fear. Evidence carries a vote further than warning does."
msgstr "Diga lo que ha visto, no lo que teme. La evidencia lleva una votación más lejos que una advertencia."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Review on"
msgstr "Revisar el"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "One copy of the village's database"
msgstr "Una copia de la base de datos de la aldea"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The role has to already carry this power, so that somebody can act the moment it crosses. Give the role the power first, watch someone use it, then hand it over."
msgstr "El rol ya tiene que llevar este poder, para que alguien pueda actuar en cuanto pase. Primero dé el poder al rol, vea a alguien usarlo, y luego entréguelo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why now"
msgstr "Por qué ahora"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which roles you propose to hold. Pick every role you would hold this season, up to three, and your terms cover them all."
msgstr "Qué roles propone ocupar. Elija cada rol que ocuparía esta temporada, hasta tres, y sus términos los cubren todos."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Propose and align"
msgstr "Proponer y alinearse"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The power"
msgstr "El poder"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The stewards have been putting every gathering on the calendar for three seasons, and the last four times an admin touched it was to fix a typo."
msgstr "Quienes custodian han puesto cada encuentro en el calendario durante tres temporadas, y las últimas cuatro veces que una persona administradora lo tocó fue para corregir una errata."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Your goals for your first moon"
msgstr "Sus metas para su primera luna"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing opens the vote to the whole roll. If it carries, the admin panel carries this one again from that day. The role keeps the power itself, so the same people can still do it; what ends is the village holding it. The village can ask for it again whenever it wants to."
msgstr "Publicar abre la votación a todo el padrón. Si se aprueba, el panel de administración vuelve a llevar este poder desde ese día. El rol conserva el poder, así que las mismas personas aún pueden usarlo; lo que termina es que la aldea lo sostenga. La aldea puede volver a pedirlo cuando quiera."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The statement"
msgstr "La declaración"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why this person"
msgstr "Por qué esta persona"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The governing purpose statement"
msgstr "La declaración de propósito"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A badge with a term is a badge the village revisits."
msgstr "Una insignia con plazo es una insignia que la aldea vuelve a revisar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to change the governing purpose statement every later change is judged against."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que cambie la declaración de propósito con la que se juzga cada cambio posterior."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What the village has been doing that makes this the right moment."
msgstr "Lo que la aldea ha venido haciendo que hace de este el momento indicado."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who would sit, and in which role."
msgstr "Quién lo ocuparía, y en qué rol."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "How this serves the village's purpose"
msgstr "Cómo esto sirve al propósito de la aldea"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Power handover"
msgstr "Traspaso de poder"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The stewards already answer most of what comes through the submissions box, and they have been forwarding it to an admin to action for two seasons."
msgstr "Quienes custodian ya responden casi todo lo que llega al buzón de envíos, y llevan dos temporadas reenviándolo a una persona administradora para que actúe."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A power held by a role that cannot use it belongs to nobody: the admin stops passing the gate and the named holder never passed it either."
msgstr "Un poder sostenido por un rol que no puede usarlo no es de nadie: la persona administradora deja de pasar el control y quien fue nombrado nunca lo pasó tampoco."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What is released, and from which token."
msgstr "Qué se libera, y de qué token."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The quests a funding round's two counts disagree on"
msgstr "Las misiones en que los dos conteos de una ronda de fondos no coinciden"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Between 10pm and 7am the common house is quiet. Anyone can name a night as an exception at the weekly circle."
msgstr "Entre las 10 p. m. y las 7 a. m. la casa común está en silencio. Cualquiera puede nombrar una noche como excepción en el círculo semanal."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing opens the vote to the whole roll. If it carries, the member sits in the role from that day until the end date, holding every power the role carries, and the village can vote the role back at any time."
msgstr "Publicar abre la votación a todo el padrón. Si se aprueba, el miembro ocupa el rol desde ese día hasta la fecha de término, con cada poder que el rol lleva, y la aldea puede votar para recuperar el rol en cualquier momento."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The words themselves. This is what the village adopts, exactly as written."
msgstr "Las palabras mismas. Esto es lo que la aldea adopta, tal como está escrito."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Seasons"
msgstr "Temporadas"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why this badge, for this person, now."
msgstr "Por qué esta insignia, para esta persona, ahora."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Grant a badge"
msgstr "Otorgar una insignia"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Change to what closing means"
msgstr "Cambio a lo que significa cerrar"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Badge grant"
msgstr "Otorgamiento de insignia"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The whole sentence, as the village would read it afterwards."
msgstr "La frase completa, tal como la aldea la leería después."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Advisory vote"
msgstr "Votación consultiva"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Reglas"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Give a role a power"
msgstr "Dar un poder a un rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Anybody seated in this role can do it the day the vote carries."
msgstr "Cualquiera que ocupe este rol puede hacerlo el día en que se aprueba la votación."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The dials"
msgstr "Los ajustes"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Required once this village has written its governing purpose statement. The whole roll reads it beside your proposal, and it stays on the record."
msgstr "Obligatorio una vez que esta aldea haya escrito su declaración de propósito. Todo el padrón la lee junto a su propuesta, y queda en el registro."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What the village would be letting a role do, and which role."
msgstr "Lo que la aldea permitiría hacer a un rol, y a cuál."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which badge, and who would wear it."
msgstr "Qué insignia, y quién la llevaría."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "This is the part the roll reads before it votes, and the part somebody quotes in five years when they ask how this village came to look after its own calendar."
msgstr "Esta es la parte que el padrón lee antes de votar, y la que alguien citará en cinco años cuando pregunte cómo esta aldea llegó a cuidar su propio calendario."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What the village got, in the words of someone who saw it."
msgstr "Lo que recibió la aldea, en palabras de alguien que lo vio."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "Círculo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "First day"
msgstr "Primer día"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why"
msgstr "Por qué"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Three proposals in a row closed before the people they affected had read them."
msgstr "Tres propuestas seguidas cerraron antes de que las personas afectadas las leyeran."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What makes this the right group of people to look after it."
msgstr "Qué hace de este el grupo indicado de personas para cuidarlo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Write it as the rule it will be. What is adopted is what is on this page."
msgstr "Escríbalo como la regla que será. Lo que se adopta es lo que está en esta página."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The village reads this beside the sentence that stands today, so write the whole thing and not the part you are changing."
msgstr "La aldea lee esto junto a la frase vigente hoy, así que escriba todo y no solo la parte que cambia."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Not tied to one domain"
msgstr "Sin un dominio en particular"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing puts the grant to the village. A passed vote awards the badge and the award carries this vote's id."
msgstr "Publicar somete el otorgamiento a la aldea. Una votación aprobada otorga la insignia, y el otorgamiento lleva el identificador de esta votación."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Rule change"
msgstr "Cambio de regla"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The two people who were working the queue have both moved on, and the village would rather hand this back than leave it with nobody answering it."
msgstr "Las dos personas que atendían la cola ya siguieron su camino, y la aldea prefiere devolver esto antes que dejarlo sin nadie que responda."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Each with a \"done when\", so anyone can check it without asking you. Members read this; a vote never shows it."
msgstr "Cada una con un \"hecho cuando\", para que cualquiera pueda comprobarla sin preguntarle. Los miembros leen esto; una votación nunca lo muestra."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Power given to a role"
msgstr "Poder dado a un rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "End date"
msgstr "Fecha de término"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The terms on offer"
msgstr "Los términos que se ofrecen"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A power that has crossed is one an admin no longer passes by being an admin. They can still act on it, and the village sees when they do."
msgstr "Un poder que ya pasó es uno que una persona administradora ya no tiene solo por serlo. Aún puede usarlo, y la aldea ve cuándo lo hace."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "This is the part the roll reads before it votes, and the part somebody reads years later to understand what happened."
msgstr "Esta es la parte que el padrón lee antes de votar, y la que alguien leerá años después para entender lo que pasó."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Your terms"
msgstr "Sus términos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The village's own powers"
msgstr "Los poderes propios de la aldea"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Leave it empty to start as soon as you join the team. Pick the first day of next season to propose for next season's roles now."
msgstr "Déjelo vacío para empezar en cuanto se una al equipo. Elija el primer día de la próxima temporada para proponer ya los roles de la próxima temporada."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "Términos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A review date is how an agreement stays a living decision instead of becoming furniture."
msgstr "Una fecha de revisión es lo que mantiene vivo un acuerdo, para que no se vuelva parte del mobiliario."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which finished quest this pays for."
msgstr "Qué misión terminada paga esto."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why you, your aim, and your goals for this moon with how you will know each is done."
msgstr "Por qué usted, su propósito y sus metas para esta luna, con cómo sabrá que cada una está hecha."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Change to the conflict agreement"
msgstr "Cambio al acuerdo de conflictos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Every role has an end. Leave the date empty and the role ends with the season."
msgstr "Todo rol tiene un final. Deje la fecha vacía y el rol termina con la temporada."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "In your words"
msgstr "En sus palabras"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why this role"
msgstr "Por qué este rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A steward role can end no later than the season's end. Any other role can run as long as the village wants."
msgstr "Un rol de custodia no puede terminar después del final de la temporada. Cualquier otro rol puede durar lo que la aldea quiera."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Seat someone in a role"
msgstr "Asignar a alguien a un rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Your proposal and its terms go to whoever welcomes people into roles, or to the whole village by vote. Every member can read the terms. A vote names the roles, never you or the money."
msgstr "Su propuesta y sus términos van a quien recibe a las personas en los roles, o a toda la aldea por votación. Todo miembro puede leer los términos. Una votación nombra los roles, nunca a usted ni el dinero."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A role handed back"
msgstr "Un rol devuelto"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Handing one back is one of the ordinary things a village does with a power."
msgstr "Devolver uno es una de las cosas comunes que una aldea hace con un poder."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A few facts, up to six references, and how a background check works. Your time zone is on your profile and your earliest start is the first day on the next step, so we don't ask them again."
msgstr "Algunos datos, hasta seis referencias, y cómo funciona una verificación de antecedentes. Su zona horaria está en su perfil y su inicio más temprano es el primer día en el siguiente paso, así que no los volvemos a pedir."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to hold one of the powers the admin panel is carrying."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que sostenga uno de los poderes que lleva el panel de administración."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A suggested change to an admin control"
msgstr "Un cambio sugerido a un control de administración"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "Tipo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Put a finished quest's payout to the village, so releasing it is the village's act."
msgstr "Someter a la aldea el pago de una misión terminada, para que liberarlo sea un acto de la aldea."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Apply for a role"
msgstr "Postularse a un rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Roles"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Revisión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Quest"
msgstr "Misión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Why you"
msgstr "Por qué usted"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The amount"
msgstr "El monto"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Recurring"
msgstr "Recurrente"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to recognise someone with a badge, on the record and with a term."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que reconozca a alguien con una insignia, en el registro y con un plazo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "One-time"
msgstr "Una sola vez"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What the village wants the record to say about this."
msgstr "Lo que la aldea quiere que el registro diga sobre esto."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "How this serves the purpose"
msgstr "Cómo esto sirve al propósito"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to let a role do something it cannot do yet."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que permita a un rol hacer algo que aún no puede hacer."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The case"
msgstr "Los motivos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Only dials the village governs appear here. Founder-held dials and the constitution are not on this list."
msgstr "Aquí solo aparecen los ajustes que gobierna la aldea. Los ajustes en manos de las personas fundadoras y la constitución no están en esta lista."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Member and role"
msgstr "Miembro y rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "She has run the repair bench every week since spring and taught four people to use it."
msgstr "Ha llevado el taller de reparaciones cada semana desde la primavera y enseñó a cuatro personas a usarlo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Leave blank for no end date."
msgstr "Déjelo en blanco para que no tenga fecha de término."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Good enough for now, safe enough to try, until this date. The date is written into the agreement, and on that day every present member is reminded. Leaving it blank makes it open-ended."
msgstr "Suficientemente bueno por ahora, suficientemente seguro para probar, hasta esta fecha. La fecha queda escrita en el acuerdo, y ese día se le recuerda a cada miembro presente. Dejarla en blanco lo deja sin fecha de término."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What you are asking for, and why it is worth the village's attention."
msgstr "Lo que pide, y por qué merece la atención de la aldea."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "About you"
msgstr "Sobre usted"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The terms"
msgstr "Los términos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who this village serves, what they are up against, the move it is making, by what means, and what becomes true if it works."
msgstr "A quién sirve esta aldea, qué enfrenta esa gente, el paso que está dando, con qué medios, y qué se vuelve cierto si funciona."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Change what this village is for"
msgstr "Cambiar para qué existe esta aldea"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Write an agreement"
msgstr "Escribir un acuerdo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing opens the vote to the whole roll. If it carries, anybody seated in the role you named can do this from that day. Nothing moves off the admin panel: this is the step that lets somebody act, and taking a power on is a separate ask the village makes later, or never."
msgstr "Publicar abre la votación a todo el padrón. Si se aprueba, cualquiera que ocupe el rol que usted nombró puede hacer esto desde ese día. Nada sale del panel de administración: este es el paso que permite a alguien actuar, y asumir un poder es un pedido aparte que la aldea hace después, o nunca."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Quest payout"
msgstr "Pago de misión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Agreement"
msgstr "Acuerdo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which of the village's goals for the season your work serves"
msgstr "A cuáles metas de la aldea para la temporada sirve su trabajo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The whole roll reads this beside your proposal before voting, and it stays on the record."
msgstr "Todo el padrón lee esto junto a su propuesta antes de votar, y queda en el registro."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "These are the powers this village is holding right now."
msgstr "Estos son los poderes que esta aldea sostiene ahora mismo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "What was done"
msgstr "Lo que se hizo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The domain decides where this agreement shows up on the power map."
msgstr "El dominio decide dónde aparece este acuerdo en el mapa de poderes."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Change of purpose"
msgstr "Cambio de propósito"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who sits in a role"
msgstr "Quién ocupa un rol"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Badge and holder"
msgstr "Insignia y portador"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Every member can read these terms. Money in them is recorded here and paid outside the platform."
msgstr "Todo miembro puede leer estos términos. El dinero que incluyen se registra aquí y se paga fuera de la plataforma."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Roles come back to the village. A role running past four seasons carries a caution on the ballot, and the vote can still carry it."
msgstr "Los roles vuelven a la aldea. Un rol que pasa de cuatro temporadas lleva una advertencia en la papeleta, y la votación aún puede aprobarlo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Badge"
msgstr "Insignia"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing puts this to the village's vote. If it carries, it becomes an active agreement, exactly as written, and its words keep the review date you set. On that date the village reminds every present member to look at it again."
msgstr "Publicar somete esto a votación de la aldea. Si se aprueba, se convierte en un acuerdo vigente, tal como está escrito, y sus palabras conservan la fecha de revisión que usted fije. Ese día la aldea recuerda a cada miembro presente que lo vuelva a mirar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "The whole roll reads this before voting."
msgstr "Todo el padrón lee esto antes de votar."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Change a rule"
msgstr "Cambiar una regla"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A new role"
msgstr "Un rol nuevo"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Food grows here every season, and two more people know how."
msgstr "Aquí crece comida cada temporada, y dos personas más saben cómo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Reasoning"
msgstr "Razonamiento"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Who holds a role, and on what terms"
msgstr "Quién ocupa un rol, y con qué términos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Decision"
msgstr "Decisión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Changes"
msgstr "Cambios"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Publishing puts this in front of the village for sensing. Once enough members support it, it can go to a vote, and a passed vote changes the dial through the one amendment ledger."
msgstr "Publicar pone esto frente a la aldea para que lo sienta. Cuando suficientes miembros lo apoyen, puede ir a votación, y una votación aprobada cambia el ajuste a través del registro único de enmiendas."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Starting the Game"
msgstr "El inicio del Juego"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "These are the powers a village can go on to hold. A power that could never leave the admin panel is not on this list, because giving a role one would be a job description and never a step toward anything."
msgstr "Estos son los poderes que una aldea puede llegar a sostener. Un poder que nunca podría salir del panel de administración no está en esta lista, porque dárselo a un rol sería una descripción de puesto y nunca un paso hacia algo."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which power the village is asking to hold, and who would look after it."
msgstr "Qué poder pide sostener la aldea, y quién lo cuidaría."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "More time to weigh in before a vote"
msgstr "Más tiempo para opinar antes de una votación"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "He has run the tool library's lending desk every Saturday since spring, and the stewards already send him the questions it gets."
msgstr "Ha atendido el préstamo de la biblioteca de herramientas cada sábado desde la primavera, y quienes custodian ya le envían las preguntas que llegan."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Pay out a quest"
msgstr "Pagar una misión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Take a power on"
msgstr "Asumir un poder"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Only the people who decide your proposal see this. No AI reads it."
msgstr "Solo quienes deciden su propuesta ven esto. Ninguna IA lo lee."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Which of the powers this village holds would go back."
msgstr "Cuál de los poderes que sostiene esta aldea se devolvería."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Moving the yardstick is measured against the yardstick that stands today."
msgstr "Mover la vara de medir se mide con la vara que rige hoy."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Whoever sits in this role can do everything it carries from the day the vote carries."
msgstr "Quien ocupe este rol puede hacer todo lo que lleva desde el día en que se aprueba la votación."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "These are the powers that can move. Some of what the admin panel does is plumbing the deployment has to keep reachable, and those are not on this list."
msgstr "Estos son los poderes que pueden moverse. Parte de lo que hace el panel de administración es infraestructura que la instalación debe mantener al alcance, y eso no está en esta lista."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Scope and review"
msgstr "Alcance y revisión"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "A grant of new tokens"
msgstr "Una emisión de tokens nuevos"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Ask the village to give one of the powers it holds back to the admin panel."
msgstr "Pedir a la aldea que devuelva al panel de administración uno de los poderes que sostiene."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "Space and land"
msgstr "Espacio y tierra"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "proposal wizard"
msgid "One line saying what this changes and which part of the purpose it serves."
msgstr "Una línea que diga qué cambia esto y a qué parte del propósito sirve."

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "WizardStepper: screen reader, after a step already done"
msgid ", done"
msgstr ", hecho"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "WizardStepper: screen reader, after the current step"
msgid ", you are here"
msgstr ", usted está aquí"

# needs-native-review: the proposal wizard, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "WizardStepper: screen reader, after a step still to come"
msgid ", to come"
msgstr ", por venir"
